Z||000015||falconhulk||12-13-2001||10:31 AM||||Cmon now you know when something is desinged towards kids.  it does not take nudity, blood or foul language to make a game adult.  Its in the plot line.  Its in the graphics.  its in the presentation.  I admit Nintendo kiddie games are good.  Just not my personal thing.  Nintendo is a great company.   Yo_sweet, this thread is in no way bashing xbox or calling for a bashing on gamecube.  Why not just acknolodge that its a good system that has a stable of games that do not appeal to you and let it go?  There is nothing to defend here.  So that puts you in the wrong on this one.||||reg||1
Z||000016||lou_dias||12-13-2001||12:32 PM||||I understand what you are saying Falconhulk.<BR>Ninetendo has a long history and lots of proprietary characters like Mario, Link, etc..  So they make their games based on them.  It's up to the third-party developers to supply the 'adult' games and I guess based on useless marketing history, they have just stayed away in the past.  I don't think this will happen with the Cube and I don't care how cute the characters look in Super Smash Bros. Meelee, that game looks like alot of fun!||||reg||1
